WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:06.100
<i>I hope I can play with Miyuki and her friends forever-kuru!</i>

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.650
I want us all to be together... the five of us, and Candy!

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.060
Because together... we're ultra happy!

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:24.160
It's almost time for Pierrot-sama's revival!

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:27.130
Just try to stop us, Precure-oni!

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:30.040
But don't be surprised when we stop you instead-da wasa!

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:32.300
Let's go...

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.400
...and save Candy!

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:41.740
{OP}

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:41.480
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.320
Smile Precure!

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:44.220
Let's go!

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.750
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:46.890
All together!

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.490
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:50.690
Jump to tomorrow!

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:53.360
Smile Precure!

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:58.200
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:00:58.470 --> 00:01:03.640
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:08.840
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:14.780
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:19.720
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:19.690
So bright!

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:24.890
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:31.330
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:31.830
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:33.000
Let's go!

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.700
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:38.640
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:43.440
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:44.010
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.680
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:46.810
Everybody!

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:48.480
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:51.020
Fly to the future!

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:54.520
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:01:55.290 --> 00:01:56.690
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:58.990
Smile Precure!

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:12.840
I can see it now-de gozaru!

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:15.640
That's it?

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.850
This is... the Bad End Kingdom?

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:28.990
Not the most inviting of places, is it?

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.830
So you had the gall to come, Precure!

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:42.570
You won't interfere with Pierrot-sama's resurrection-da wasa!

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:45.280
Where's Candy?! Give her back!

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.810
If you want your little lamb, she's over there.

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:55.520
Candy!

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:58.220
If you want to save her, go right ahead-oni!

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:03.060
But you'll have to get through us first!

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:07.730
We will save Candy, no matter what!

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:09.740
Let's transform!

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:10.700
Right!

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.140
Ready?

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:19.460
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:20.010
Go!

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:29.390
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.230
Cure Happy!

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:37.100
Dazzling sun!

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.030
Hot-blooded power!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:41.640
Cure Sunny!

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:47.400
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:50.420
Cure Peace!

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:56.150
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:59.230
Cure March!

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:05.280
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:07.970
Cure Beauty!

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.800
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:22.820
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.120
We'll handle these guys!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.780
You go and save Candy, Happy!

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:34.150
But—

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:37.330
Our goal is to rescue Candy, is it not?

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:43.030
Doing so will be impossible without anyone staying behind to keep them at bay.

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:45.660
Happy! We need you to save Candy!

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:48.200
Alright!

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:51.900
Remember, we're not just here to save Candy.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:59.170
When we're done, we're not leaving anybody behind.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:01.570
It's a promise, alright?

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:04.200
You got it!

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:07.730
It's a promise!

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:11.990
Finished your little party yet?

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:18.160
Your little lamb's going to die, just like the rest of you!

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:18.990
Come on!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.070
Smoke bombs, go-de gozaru!

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:27.970
You and your cheap tricks!

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:32.670
Like hell you're getting away!

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:34.480
What?!

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:37.180
You're up against me!

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:39.260
And you are not...

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.620
...getting past us!

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:47.390
Such a touching display of friendship.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:47.960
However...

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:52.630
Joker!

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:55.160
...sadly it shall amount to nothing!

00:05:58.330 --> 00:05:59.720
Happy, get going!

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:01.150
Beauty!

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:11.080
Knowing you and your penchant for sneaky tricks,

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:13.480
I expected you would show up at the last possible moment.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.650
I think I'll have some fun playing with you!

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.490
We will rescue Candy, no matter what.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:25.160
Then we shall all return home, <i>together.</i>

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:26.930
Fun indeed!

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:31.300
Come, now, my fellow commanders! Let us begin!

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:35.950
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:38.370
...a Bad End!

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:42.620
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness!

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:50.050
Cure Sunny! It's time someone made that dazzling sun of yours set!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:54.390
Ya think so, huh? I was just thinkin' of turning your fur into a sweater!

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:59.900
Cure Peace! You really think a crybaby like you stands a chance against me-oni?!

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:03.470
Maybe I <i>am</i> a crybaby... but I've got guts!

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:08.870
Cure March! You think you can beat a twisted witch like me-da wasa?!

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:10.480
Time to lay down the gauntlet!

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.110
No, my dear. It's Majorina Time-da wasa!

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:20.150
She got younger?!

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:23.380
Allow me to repeat myself, Cure Beauty.

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:26.910
Your wishes were naught but false hopes.

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:29.750
Happy will save Candy, I'm sure of it.

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:33.830
I owe it to her to do my absolute utmost to stop you!

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:36.840
Oh, how exciting...

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:50.080
<i>Hang in there, Candy... I'm on my way!</i>

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:00.390
Happy!

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:07.290
Candy!

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.830
I'm afraid I have a few new tricks up my sleeve in this form.

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:51.930
Can you figure out which one's the real me~?

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:09.540
Oh no~!

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:16.640
Too bad, my dear. I'm afraid you're all simply no match for us!

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:21.480
<i>Candy, hang in there... I'm on my way!</i>

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:30.830
I-I can't stop!

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:32.620
Lava?!

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:43.770
Happy?! Happy!

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:45.540
That's Candy!

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:49.970
Precure...

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:52.880
Happy Shower!

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:55.340
Candy!

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:56.100
Happy!

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.710
Happy!

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:01.260
Candy!

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:06.560
Don't worry, Candy! I'm here to save y—huh?

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:08.730
The Décor Decor!

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:13.130
Akanbe!

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:15.050
A yellow-nosed Akanbe...?!

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:26.650
Happy!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.390
Club plus oni equals triple strong-oni!

00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:47.420
Can you tell which one's the real me?

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.740
Obviously not, it seems!

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:01.950
By what ridiculous logic do you even think you have a hope of winning?

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:09.470
Away you go!

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:10.490
Beauty!

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:11.710
Pop!

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:18.230
One of the Décors is still in my possession,

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:20.930
so don't assume you're getting the full set!

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:42.260
This is boring! Let's go deal with Cure Happy!

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:46.920
This ain't over...!

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:49.340
We aren't going to let you...

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:51.340
...get to Happy...!

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:55.970
You still won't stay down? You don't know what's good for you!

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:58.440
You have no hope of beating us!

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:02.140
All you're doing is putting yourself through more torment.

00:12:02.510 --> 00:12:04.640
Now, let me go-oni!

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.150
She's crying!

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:14.290
What a crybaby-oni!

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:16.220
My whole body hurts... I'm scared...

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:22.360
But if I run away now... I won't get to be together with Candy and everyone else again!

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:25.330
Losing a friend scares me more than anything!

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:27.300
So I'm running nowhere!

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:32.240
I know Happy's gonna save Candy...

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:35.810
...so I'm gonna stop you, no matter what...

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:40.120
We're all goin' home, together!

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:46.860
We promised her... and we keep our promises!

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:52.330
Your evil acts have opened our eyes...

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.990
...to what is truly important to us...

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:58.350
Have we now?

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:03.400
Hang on, Candy! I'll save you!

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.370
Happy!

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:07.860
Akanbe!

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:11.110
Give Candy back!

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:15.130
She means everything to us! She's our...

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:17.760
She's our friend!

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:22.290
Bah! Who needs friends?

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:24.090
How stupid-oni!

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:26.710
I'm amazed anyone could even care.

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:31.110
Are friends truly worth getting yourselves killed over?

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:37.030
Having friends isn't stupid at all!

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:42.020
Through the good times and the bad, they'll always be there for you!

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:47.250
We can all laugh together, and when we're feeling sad, we can cheer each other up!

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:51.660
With our friends at our side, nothing can hold us back!

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:54.520
That is the power they bestow!

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.360
It's all about being together!

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:00.440
With Candy, our friends, our families...

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:02.590
We've got to stick together!

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:04.600
Because they're what make us...

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:08.580
...ultra happy!

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:13.890
Shining bright,

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:18.180
Smile Precure!

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:27.320
Are you serious?!

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:33.030
If that's what it takes to protect my friends, damn right I am!

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:41.870
Out of my way-oni!

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:44.360
You're not getting past us!

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:46.170
You won't escape!

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:11.000
Precure...

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:13.000
Sunny Fire!

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:24.240
I've had enough of you-oni!

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:38.320
Precure...

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:41.610
Peace...

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.380
Thunder!

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:52.110
That's enough toying around.

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:56.160
I don't have time to figure out which one's real...

00:15:56.820 --> 00:15:58.210
Time to throw down the gauntlet!

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:00.340
Precure...

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:03.840
March Shoot!

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:05.340
You fool.

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:09.360
Yup, wrong one. And now, you've nothing left to—

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:29.640
What?!

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:31.740
Too bad for you!

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:35.460
Precure...

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:37.460
Beauty...

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:39.460
Blizzard!

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:43.990
Pierrot-sama!

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:50.010
Akan...!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:51.760
Precure...

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:55.320
Happy...

00:16:56.060 --> 00:16:57.560
Shower!

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:14.950
The Star Décor!

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:17.420
Happy!

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:19.120
Candy...

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:23.600
Thank god... thank god you're safe...

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:28.240
We've gotta get out of here!

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:49.630
Happy! Candy!

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:50.060
You all came!

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:50.980
Candy!

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:52.110
Candy!

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:52.490
Onii-chan!

00:17:52.950 --> 00:17:54.560
You're all okay!

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:55.960
This ain't over yet!

00:17:56.270 --> 00:17:57.610
We have to stop Pierrot!

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.070
Happy, we have the final Décor here.

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:03.570
Quickly, put it in the Décor Decor-kuru!

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:10.280
Now we can revive the Royal Queen, and she'll beat Pierrot for us-kuru!

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:12.910
Huh?

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:15.650
Nothing's happening!

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:27.520
My name is Emperor Pierrot...

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:30.620
All stories shall be given their Bad Ending...

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:33.360
That's Pierrot...

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:40.870
He's using the Bad Energy Cannon?! That thing could destroy an entire planet-de gozaru!

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.280
Quickly, we have to get out of here-de gozaru!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:49.850
Pop, take Candy and escape! We'll do everything we can to stop him!

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:52.020
Let's Go!

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:54.470
Precure...

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:00.670
Rainbow...

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:02.420
Healing!

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:13.640
Nooo!

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:22.650
A new world without purpose or will...

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:25.680
The Precure will keep everyone smiling-kuru!

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:31.090
They won't lose... they won't lose to you-kuru!

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:35.910
That's right... We can't... give up now!

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:46.410
Let the protection of the pegasus be upon you, Precure...

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:52.800
Is that the Queen...?

00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:57.120
Thank you!

00:19:58.450 --> 00:19:59.800
Let's do this!

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:01.170
Right!

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:08.140
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:24.660
Princess Happy!

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:27.100
Princess Sunny!

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:29.270
Princess Peace!

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.410
Princess March!

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:33.860
Princess Beauty!

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:41.650
Precure: Princess Form!

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:51.860
May the light of hope shine!

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:54.750
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:01.560
Precure...

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:07.750
Rainbow Burst!

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:34.160
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:21:57.110 --> 00:21:58.770
Candy!

00:21:58.910 --> 00:22:01.200
Miyuki! You guys!

00:23:39.800 --> 00:23:42.100
Everyone, welcome to Marchenland-kuru!

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:43.800
You're all fairies now-kuru!

00:23:43.800 --> 00:23:44.650
What's going on?

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:47.100
What's this? We are so cute-nao!

00:23:47.100 --> 00:23:48.750
We're certainly lovely-desu.

00:23:48.750 --> 00:23:50.150
This is so fun-yayo!

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:52.900
Why are y'all talking like fairies-ane?

00:23:52.900 --> 00:23:53.800
What did I say-ane!?

00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:55.800
Everyone, let's go-kuru!

00:23:56.750 --> 00:23:58.300
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.140 --> 00:24:03.940
Find your ultra happy smile!
